Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, take this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There {\i1}are{\i0} ways of handing this to me \Nthat are a bit more poignant, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congrats. You too are now \Nofficially a dog of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Havoc, take him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:43.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief, don't make that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Lt. Colonel is wrapped up in something of a tough case right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A case?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A serial killer who only \Ngoes after women.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a job for the police, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the military lets it go for \Ntoo long in their own backyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:02.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it becomes a matter of honor, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's after another promotion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is true that the Lt. Colonel is a man who won't hesitate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to use any means necessary to get promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if that's all he ever did, we wouldn't follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:22.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ta-daa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Hold it! Hold it, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give that back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fooling around again...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:55.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it back! Please, give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the talk of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:04:00.97,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,Whoever would've thought that a twelve-year-old could pass the certification exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prodigies. They do exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:10.18,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Well, to celebrate Edward-kun passing his test, \Nwe're going to have a big feast today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you like to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tucker-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a message from \Nthe Lt. Colonel for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Assessment day will be here soon."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I'm looking forward to it."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:32.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This assessment thing—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is it for State Alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:42.96,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,If I don't report the findings of my research and get evaluated once every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my certification as a State Alchemist will be taken from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Last year, I didn't receive a good evaluation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I have to do better this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let 'em have it, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you go with a Chimera that can understand human speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once you complete it, please show us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once it's complete, I'll be sure to let you two have a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A letter? Who are you writing to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It doesn't matter who it's to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, Brother, it's to Winry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's just a simple report!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I just succeeded in becoming a State Alchemist! Take that!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sort of thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Winry Big Brother's girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! She's not! She's not! \NShe's not! She's not! She's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to write \Nmy mom a letter too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, your mom is far away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. She said Dad was a good-for-nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:02.50,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,and she couldn't put up with him anymore, so she went back to her parents' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope Mom sends me a reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My wife couldn't stand being poor and left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was just before \NI became a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If my certification is taken from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we'll fall back to the way \Nthings were then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to keep this lifestyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to pass this assessment, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa, good luck studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.57,0:07:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you want to go for a walk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not this simple stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:32.47,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I want to find out about a Chimera that \Na man named Tucker created two years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Scieszka, do you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shou Tucker-san's reports are restricted reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you check on it, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not any ordinary person, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:46.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you have permission from Brigadier General Basque Grand—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brigadier General Basque Grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know the \NIron Blood Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the foremost authority on \Nredirecting alchemy to military tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:03.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you need his permission, \Nthat must mean it's a military secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Military secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't go in! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This first branch is only for State Alchemist use,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and no one without permission from the military can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:18.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I was told that this is the only place where I would find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:19.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but those seem to be the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand. \NWhy would you place this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this despicable alchemy brand upon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, Elicia-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:06.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's your big brother Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honey, pay attention to what Ed-chan is saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Tucker's Chimera, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Major, you're in the \NInvestigations Department, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you might know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could just ask him yourself, \Ncouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he's so busy now, \Njust before his assessment, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:36.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know all that much myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say that Tucker is the first person in history to create a Chimera
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that could speak and \Nunderstand human language.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear that the Chimera definitely said one thing: "I want to die."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, after that, \Nit didn't eat anything and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Tucker-san \Nwould create such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:03.65,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,But there was someone in the military who at least \Nthought there was some value in utilizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Tucker-san's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:09.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean the one who died before they came to Central?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I mistaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That serial killer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:30.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This makes the fifth one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hasn't Investigations found anything yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you saw \Nsomething awful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been calling for your mother the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And apologizing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had my suspicions \Never since I saw your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mother, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must've been tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you did was forbidden from the outset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I understand how you must've felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:03.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what Mustang told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:08.33,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,but matters concerning Shou Tucker fall under the jurisdiction of me, Basque Grand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basque Grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:11.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Sewing Life Alchemist's research is one of the military's most secret matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is not an area upon which \Nothers may tread frivolously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be back in a little while \Nto play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:35.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make sure you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not aggravating to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:47.82,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I hear that when that kid showed off his transmutation abilities without using a circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:51.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Führer bestowed \Nwords of praise upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, that upstart Mustang was able to score some more points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:13:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I managed to smooth things over last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you don't show \Nany results this year too,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I will be put in an awkward position for having supported you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:07.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather yield the title of Sewing Life Alchemist to that kid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and go back to \Nyour former lifestyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A life of wandering from town to town \Non an empty stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your assessment will be held the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:34.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you hurt somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm at the end of the line here, Nina.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:56.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if by doing this, the certification \Nyou worked so hard to get is taken away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's nothing here, \Nit'll be fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.53,0:14:35.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:42.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a finished version of a Chimera that can understand human words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, that person is Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed... ward...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely... done...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable! It really is talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I managed to make it \Nin time for the assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.35,0:15:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I can get by without having to worry about research funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed... ward...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big... Brother... Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:07.70,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,When was the first time you transmuted \Na Chimera that could understand human language?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when did your wife leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:17.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:21.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do your letters still reach your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where have Nina and Alexander gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:35.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate perceptive kids like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:40.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your own wife?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he used his own daughter and dog \Nto transmute a Chimera!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:51.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's easy when you \Nuse people, huh? Yeah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you so upset about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As is typical of medical science,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:17:00.40,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,the advancement of mankind comes as the result of countless animal experiments, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:01.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since you, too, are a scientist—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.95,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:06.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can get away with something like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With toying around with people's lives like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People's lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, people's lives, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your arm and leg \Nand your brother's body—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,aren't they also results of \Ntoying around with people's lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, Tucker-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you need to \Npass your assessment
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so that you could continue your life with Nina?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no reason to \Ncreate the Chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The possibility was there \Nbefore my eyes, so I tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:48.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Chimera that could \Nunderstand human words—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:51.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see \Nif I could make one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew that it was anathema,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't help myself from \Ntrying out a human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:04.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a scientist—no, as a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there are no bounds to your desire to \Nput your own knowledge into practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:13.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to test out what kind of power has been given to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by learning all of the secrets that are hidden in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is the essence of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not... Alchemy isn't... this sort of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not! I'm not! I'm not! I'm not! I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:36.63,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Brother! He'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big... Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:18:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina, this might hurt a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:58.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Are you planning to re-transmute her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not something we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My Chimera has been perfectly transmuted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody can return it \Nto the way it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful! Make sure you don't do to her \Nwhat you did to your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's play...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's play...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.43,0:19:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Edward Elric?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He used his own daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Chimera and Tucker will be dealt with in conjunction with a court martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will not speak of what you saw here to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:49.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on! You guys knew what\NTucker had done, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just getting rid of the eviden—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:19:59.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:09.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I'm not about to let you whisk them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are composed of both man and beast, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would I know such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How regrettable...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:09.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O God, that great God who hast created us and all other things...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please receive this woeful spirit into thy bosom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}God, I now understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The reason why my brother \Ngave me this accursed arm—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:54.20,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,{\i1}it was so that I would take those alchemists, who have departed from the path of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and with their same devilish works,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as though she was decomposed by an alchemist...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But who...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.57,0:22:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, even if we were to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:16.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:40.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.57,0:23:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 8: "The Philosopher's Stone"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:46.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're only children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.11,0:23:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, we can still...
